      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>C\u00fcrc\u0101ne-i \u1e2a\u02c7\u0101rezm</em>: It is a pleasant city, and one of its names is <em>G\u00fcrgenc-i \u1e62u\u0121r\u0101</em>. In the <em>\u1e2a\u0101rezm</em> (Khwarazm) province, on both sides of the <em>nehr-i Cey\u1e25\u016bn</em> (the Oxus / Amu Darya River), there are said to be sixty thousand inhabited villages. [translation]</p>",
